    "Name": "Ettin",
    "Details": "The original Ettin variant, the B1G relies on what is practically a full laser loadout. Four ER Large and 6 ER Medium Lasers, and an additional toe-mounted Small Laser, provide large amount of sustained fire. However, the heat management is clearly suboptimal, as its 18 prototype heat sinks are far from enough to handle the heat of all its weapons.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Lifesupport</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.4</color></b>",
